SUMMARY:Call For Artists
DESCRIPTION:CALL FOR ARTISTS \n																														 \n\nOrganization: Halo Arts Project\, Inc not-for-profit 501 c 3 organization\nArt Submission Deadline: December 31\, 2026\nEvent Date: Sunday\, January 24\, 2027\nLocation: Waterworks SRQ\, Sarasota\, FL\nEntry Fee: FREE\nEligibility: Open to Artists nationwide over the age of 18. All visual artistic mediums are eligible\, including 2-D and 3-D (sculpture)\, textile\, craft/traditional and any style: landscape\, abstract\, figurative\, collage.\nCategories: No larger than 36 x 36\n\n  \nCall to Artists  \n“The Shape of Things to Come” it is not fixed – it’s restless\, unfinished and alive.Artist’s submission deadline December 31\, 2026.  One work.  One deadline.  A Real Impact!\nin**@*************ct.com  \n8th Annual Angels for Artists Online & Live Art Auction\nThe event funds $5\,000 Halo Fellowship Awards to Florida Visual Artists.\nDescription \n“The Shape of Things to Come”\nThe shape of things to come is not fixed – it’s restless\, unfinished\, and alive. The 2027 Halo Arts Project exhibition will feature art that traces the contours of a future still being formed. The imagination bends reality and each work becomes a prophecy of what we are becoming or perhaps where we are headed. \nRather than offering certainty\, the exhibition embraces interpretation. The future is presented not as a destination\, but as an active process shaped by human hands\, systems\, desires\, and imagination itself. Through painting\, sculpture\, installation\, photography\, textile\, and interdisciplinary practices\, artists become architects of possibility\, translating aspirations into tangible form. \nArtists are invited to submit paintings\, prints\, archival photography\, small sculptures\, and mixed media works that explores beauty through many lenses. The exhibition celebrates varied expression and aesthetic appreciation.  Join us in creating a captivating aura that goes beyond what meets the eye. Explore the mirror of this powerful social construct that reflects and shapes a society’s values\, fears\, and aspirations.  \n															\n																														 \nMARK YOUR CALENDARS FOR JANUARY 2027\nAngles For Artists Live & Online Art Auction: Sunday\, January 24\, 2027\nLocation: Waterworks SRQ \nAngels for Artists raises funds and exists to provide financial resources and programming support to Visual Artists in Florida.  The Online and Live Art Auction is a fun-filled fundraising event\, and great way to add original artworks to your home or office art collection.  \n					\n									Read More About Angels For Artists\n					 \n \nARTISTS AND COLLECTORS!  \nInterested in donating a piece(s) of ART?\n					\n									Click Here To Learn How To Donate Artwork\n					\n																														 \nDays Left to Enter — Get Your Entry in by December 31\, 2026!\n			 Days Hours Minutes Seconds		 \nSign the front of your canvas and legibly print your name AND TITLE on the back. \nSpace is limited for this opportunity to get some great exposure and to help fund Halo Fellowship Awards for Visual Artists. \n															\n															\n																														 \nCall For Artists Registration\nPlease fill out all of the information fields below and upload your artwork. Thank you! \nName *Email Address *Street Address *Apartment\, suite\, etcCity *State/Province *ZIP / Postal Code *Phone *Title of Painting: *What is the size of the work? *What is the medium? *What is the value of the work? *Short BIO-Statement *Upload files: Please submit up to 3 on-line photographs of your artUnder 2mb each\, jpg\, pdf\, png\, gif files accepted.Drag and Drop (or) Choose Files Rules and Procedures• Sign the front of your canvas and legibly print your name AND TITLE on the back.\n\n\n• All Paintings can be submitted at any time but no later than December 31\, 2026.• There will be scheduled drop-off dates & times available during the months of September\, October and November. Please email info@haloartsproject.com for more information. \n\nTerms & Conditions• Deadline for Registration: All Paintings can be submitted at any time\, but no later than December 31\, 2026. \n• All donated paintings become the property of Halo Arts Project\, Inc. who reserves the right to showcase artists work and photos or copies thereof\, in any advertising\, publication or website. \n• Halo Arts Project\, Inc. reserves the right to reject any submission it deems inappropriate. Consent *Yes\, I agree with the terms and conditions.  Submit\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n	Name *\n\n	 \n	Email *\n\n	 \n	Address *\n\n	 \n	City *\n\n	 \n	State *\n\n	 \n	Zip *\n\n	 \n	Phone Number *\n\n	 \n	Title of Painting: *\n\n	 \n	What is the size of the work? *\n\n	 \n	What is the medium? *\n\n	 \n	What is the value of the work? *\n\n	 \n	Short BIO- Statement *\n\n	 \n	 Please submit up to 3 on-line photographs of your art (under 2mb each\, jpg\, pdf\, png\, gif files accepted)\n\n	 \n	\n	\n	\n		Rules & Procedures:\n• Sign the front of your canvas and legibly print your name AND TITLE on the back.\n• All Paintings can be submitted at any time but no later than December 31\, 2025.\n• There will be scheduled drop-off dates & times available during the months of September\, October and November. Please email info@haloartsproject.com for more information.\n		 \n	\n	Terms & Conditions:\n\n• Deadline for Registration: All Paintings can be submitted at any time\, but no later than December 31\, 2025.\n• All donated paintings become the property of Halo Arts Project\, Inc. who reserves the right to showcase artists work\, and photos or copies thereof\, in any advertising\, publication or website. \n• Halo Arts Project\, Inc. reserves the right to reject any submission it deems inappropriate.\n	 \n	\n		I consent to the terms & conditions.\n		 \n	\n	\n	\n\n	\n		\n		\n		\n		\n	\n\n\n	\n	\n		\n		 \n	\nΔ\n \n\n\n \nNOTE: YOU MUST CHECK THE BOX NEXT TO  “I consent to the terms & conditions”  above the “Submit” button for the form to be submitted. \nYou will receive a confirmation email when we receive your form. 
URL:https://haloartsproject.com/event/call-for-artists-registration/
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://haloartsproject.com/wp-content/uploads/IG-Calling-All-Artists-Art-0526R2.jpg
END:VEVENT
