UID:10000019-1792368000-1795910399@haloartsproject.com
SUMMARY:Florida Now
DESCRIPTION:“Florida Now”\nCollaborators Blair Peterson-Updike and Nathan LeemisOctober 19 – November 28\, 2026 \nExploring the St. John’s River and oil painting along the way.  The St. John’s has a rich historyas a subject for painters.  They explore the Florida landscape\, conservation\, ecology\, and historyin Traditional\, Impressionistic\, Tonalist and Naturalistic styles.  Updike & Leemis are Halo Fellowship Recipients 2025. \nOpen: Thursday – Sunday 1:00pm to 6:00pm
URL:https://haloartsproject.com/event/florida-now/
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://haloartsproject.com/wp-content/uploads/FloridaNow.jpg
END:VEVENT
