UID:10000008-1800808200-1800822600@haloartsproject.com
SUMMARY:Angels for Artists - Art Auction
DESCRIPTION:When:\nJanuary 24\, 2027 • 4:30pm-8:30pm\nWhere:\nWaterworks SRQ • 1005 N. Orange Ave.\, Sarasota FL\, 34236\n\n  \nRegister & Purchase Tickets For Angels for Artists\nIf you would like to bid on artwork in the auction please register by clicking the button on the left. To purchase tickets to attend the auction in person please purchase your tickets by clicking the button on the right. Tickets go on sale October 21\, 2025. Thank you. We look forward to seeing you there! \n  \nRegister For The Auction \nPurchase Tickets Here \nJohn Sims Studio / Halo Arts Gallery Address & Hours \nAbsentee Bidding opens on January 7\, 2026 at Noon\, you MUST REGISTER. Registration is FREE. Art auction will open on Sunday\, January 25\, 2026 at 4:30pm EST and close at 8:30pm EST.Shipping costs are added to each work depending on size. All Sales Final – No Refunds. \n2026 Angels For Artists Event Photos\n  \nSAVE THE DATE for\nSunday January 24\, 2027!\nJoin us for Halo Arts Project’s 8th annual\n \nbenefit Online & LIVE Art Auction and Art Cocktail Party.  The benefit is Halo Arts Project’s key fundraiser and you can bid in-person on over 100 artworks from January 4 – 24\, 2027. All proceeds support $5\,000 Halo Fellowship Awards for visual artists of Florida. \nThis event is an evening full of fun and excitement at the Historic Sarasota Waterworks\n  \nDoors open at 4:30pm\nSign up for a historic tour of Waterworks\nLIVE Auction begins: 8:00pm and the excitement climbs by demand until the final seconds\nOnline Auction ends – 8:30pm \nTo add to the energy\, the works which you will see online from January 4–24\, will be hung in the John Sims/Halo Arts Project Gallery: 1639 Tenth Street\, Sarasota\, FL 34236. On January 24 they will be hanging at Sarasota Waterworks for our lively auction and art cocktail party. \nSneak peek available at the John Sims Studio/Halo Arts Project 11639 Tenth Street\, Sarasota\, FL 34236. \n\n\n\n \nThere are Three Ways to Attend Angels for Artists\n(Tickets on sale soon!) \n \n\nBECOME A SPONSOR\nAll Sponsors\nAll levels receive tickets\, plus are invited to an exclusive Art Talk Cocktail Party at the Gallery. All Medici\, DaVinci\, O’Keefe\, Halo Angel sponsors are invited to be a part of the Halo Arts Project Event Committee. \n\n\nMedici… 20 Guests We will commission a framed 14″x16″ framed painting for you. Invited to an exclusive Art Talk Cocktail Party at the Gallery\n\n\n\n\nDaVinci … 10 Guests We will commission a framed 12×12 framed painting for you.Invited to an exclusive Art Talk Cocktail Party at the Gallery\n\n\n\n\nGeorgia O’Keefe … 6 Guests Invited to an exclusive Art Talk Cocktail Party at the Gallery\n\n\n\n\nHalo Angel … 4 GuestsInvited to an exclusive Art Talk Cocktail Party at the Gallery\n\n\n  \nBecome A Sponsor \n \n\nEVENT TICKETS\nTicket $25 – Includes Aperitivo & Art Cocktail Party + Historic tour of the Waterworks building. \n\n\n\n\n \nTickets\nThe numbers below include tickets for this event already in your cart. Clicking “Get Tickets” will allow you to edit any existing attendee information as well as change ticket quantities.\n2026 Angels for Artists Ticket\nBuy a ticket to attend the 2026 Angels for Artists event January 25\, 2026. Tickets are $25/person.\n$\n25.00\nUnlimited\n\nDecrease ticket quantity for 2026 Angels for Artists Ticket\n–\n\nQuantity \n\n\nIncrease ticket quantity for 2026 Angels for Artists Ticket\n+\n\nQuantity:\n0\nTotal:\n$\n0.00\n\nGet Tickets \n\n  \nPurchase Tickets Here \n \n\nArtists and Collectors!\nInterested in donating a piece(s) of ART?\nEVENT TICKETS\nParticipating Artists Ticket – Complimentary – Includes Aperitivo & Art Cocktail Party + Historic tour of the Waterworks building. \n  \nLearn How To Donate \n\n\n \nLive Music by C KNIGHT & THE DAZE\nBLUES…BEADS…BOOGIE\nA “New Orleans ” Style of Party\nTo Visit C. Night & The Daze Website – Click Here \n\nTICKETS are AVAILABLE ON JANUARY 1ST – ARTISTS WHO ARE PARTICIPATING BY DONATING THEIR PAINTING ARE GIVEN A COMP TICKET. All other tickets are $25 — includes Aperitivo\nSNEAK PEEK AT THE ONLINE ART CATALOGUE BEGINS JANUARY 4TH. YOU MUST REGISTER TO PREVIEW. THERE IS NO REGISTRATION FEE.\nWE ARE OPENING THE AUCTION FOR ABSENTEE BIDDING BEGINNING ON WednesDAY\, JANUARY 7th at Noon. YOU MUST REGISTER TO BID. THERE IS NO REGISTRATION FEE.\nArtworks Auctioned — Bids starting at $75\nJoin us to support artists Fellowship Awards. Great opportunity to add exceptional art to your home/office collection\nIn person Gallery event at SRQ Waterworks on January 25th begins 4:30pm and ends 8:30pm EST sharp\nAperitivo\, Mingle with the Artists and Visit the Historic Waterworks\nALL BIDDING ENDS ON Sunday THE 25TH of January AT 8:30PM EST. YOU WILL BE AUTOMATICALLY NOTIFIED ON YOUR CELLULAR DEVICE WHEN YOU ARE OUTBID.\n\nFOR MORE INFORMATION EMAIL IN**@**************TS.COM \nArtists Participating in Angels for Artists 2026\nAlicia Brown\nAshley Rivers\nAndrea Cardenal\nAnja Palombo\nAnn Boroughs\nBunny Scudder\nBianca Silket\nBeck Lane\nBetsy Tomasso\nBix Mannion\nClaudia Ryan\,\nClifford McDonald\nCarol Cathell\nCraig Palmer\nDaniel Cleal \nDebra KealKahn\nDalia Shyevitch\nDenise Flynn\nDan Wilkerson\nEkaterina Vygolova\nFrancine Vitiello\nFrank Creaturo\nHerion Park\nJackie Cutrone\nJanet Mishner\nJoan Davidson\nJune Flagel\nJoan Libby Hawk\nJerome Chesley\nJana Millstone \nJanice Neuman\nKathy Houghton\nKathy Wright\nKim Anderson\nKate Hendrickson\nLaine Nixon\nLaurie Maves Guglielmi\nLisa Craven\nLynn Elkes\nLeslie Butterfield\nLisa Matway\nMally Khorasantchi\nMar Martinez\nMaryann Vitiello\nMeg Pierce \nMichelle Ver Way\nMonica Swartley\nMelissa Labutti\nMidge Johnson\nNatasha Dikareva\nPamela Olin\nPhilomena Morano\nRenee Youngberg\nRob Tarbell\nSunny Strickland\nSuzette Jones\nTatiana Pujan\nTim Jaeger\nVera Neuman-Wood\nZerbe Sodervick \n \n  \nAngels for Artists 2023 Event Photos \nFrequently Asked Questions\n1. When is Angels for Artist in 2026? \nAngels for Artists Event 2026 will be held on Sunday\, January 24th.  The event begins at 4:30pm and ends at 8:30pm EST. \nWe are opening the bidding early\, artwork will be available to absentee bid at the Online Art Auction beginning Coming Soon. \nTo participate in the Online Bidding\, you must register to bid with name\, address\, phone number and credit card info.  Credit card info is not saved for any other use than the item(s) you are bidding to win.  To register click here. \n2. What percentage of the selling price is a donation to Halo Arts Project? \nArtists have donated their time and important artwork to benefit Halo Fellowship Awards for Visual Artists. Many artists donate year after year and love attending the event\, knowing they are making a difference supporting other artists and the arts community. Therefore\, 100% of the proceeds collected from the Art Auctions\, private donations and Events goes to fund the Halo Fellowship Awards.  Click to see previous awardees. \nHalo Arts Project Inc\, is a registered 501 C 3 IRS charity.  Donations are deductible within the extent of the law.  Halo Arts Project\, Inc is a registered Corporation in the State of Florida. Doc# N19000001673.
URL:https://haloartsproject.com/event/angels-for-artists/
LOCATION:SRQ Waterworks\, 1005 N. Orange Ave.\, Sarasota\, FL\, 34236\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://haloartsproject.com/wp-content/uploads/Angels-For-Artists-Instagram-0526R2.jpg
END:VEVENT
